<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When we say Amen before God to the fact</l><l>That Christ is the yes, Christ is the yes,</l><l>Christ is the fulfillment of all God’s promises,</l><l>This is a glory to God through us.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
